      "ruleId": "ssc-62f73c89-9858-4a64-903f-a5b5fdba7c01",
      "title": "Improper Check for Unusual or Exceptional Conditions in net.minidev:json-smart",
      "description": "Affected versions of net.minidev:json-smart 2.3.x before 2.3.1, net.minidev:json-smart 2.4.x before 2.4.1, net.minidev:json-smart-mini 1.3.x before 1.3.2, and net.minidev:json-smart 1.3.x before 1.3.2 are vulnerable to Improper Check For Unusual Or Exceptional Conditions. The vulnerability arises from an uncaught exception (e.g., NumberFormatException) thrown from a function, potentially causing program crashes or sensitive information exposure, as the parser fails to generate a ParseException when expecting float number input that is not valid, resulting in unhandled exceptions and potential Denial-of-Service (DoS) scenarios due to unexpected input.",
      "ecosystem": "maven",
      "severity": "MEDIUM",
